~ start
Grok the Goblin: Aye man, ready to gamble all your money away? 
$> Global.goblin_losses=0
...
- What are the rules?
	Grok the Goblin: Great, Great. The rules are simple. 
	Grok the Goblin: You will choose a dice, and depending on the dice, a bet. 
	Grok the Goblin: You give me money. 
	Grok the Goblin: And I will roll the dice!
	Grok the Goblin: If you get a 1 on the dice
	Grok the Goblin: I will pay you.
	Grok the Goblin: Otherwise I won't return you the money. 
	=> start
- Hell Yeah!
	=> main_gamble
- Hell Naw!
	$> Global.action=""
=> END

~ main_gamble

Choose a bet!
- sides: 4, bet: 1$, payout: 5$ [if Global.money>=1 /]
	$> Global.money-=1
	if Global.d_randi_range(1,6)==1:
		Grok the Goblin: You rolled a 1!
		Grok the Goblin: Means i have to pay you the 5 dollars
		$> Global.goblin_losses=0
		$> Global.money+=5
	else:
		Grok the Goblin: You rolled a {{Global.d_randi_range(2,4)}}!
		Grok the Goblin: Unlucky, no money for you!
		$> Global.goblin_losses+=1
	=> main_gamble
- sides: 6, bet: 5$, payout: 40$ [if Global.money>=5 /]
	$> Global.money-=5
	if Global.d_randi_range(1,9)==1:
		Grok the Goblin: You rolled a 1!
		Grok the Goblin: Means i have to pay you the 40 dollars
		$> Global.goblin_losses=0
		$> Global.money+=40
	else:
		Grok the Goblin: You rolled a {{Global.d_randi_range(2,6)}}!
		Grok the Goblin: Unlucky, no money for you!
		$> Global.goblin_losses+=1
	=> main_gamble
- *Beat the goblin to death* [if Global.goblin_losses>4 and Global.combat_unlocked /]
	$> Global.pre_combat_scene="res://location_scenes/Riga/The Dice Goblin/rolling dice.tscn"
	$> Global.start_combat(["Dice Goblin"])
	=> END
- No more gambling :(
	$> Global.action=""
	=> END
=> END

~ combat_victory
Grok the Goblin: Fine, you won, ugh..
Grok the Goblin: Take this
$> Global.player_gain_card("Lucky Strike")
Grok the Goblin: And never show your face in here again!
$> Global.action=""
=> END 